ked Guy Harris for a series of high-energy football commentator voiceovers during the World Cup. Watch the ads and hear the commentary style.\",\"uploadDate\":\"2018-06-01T00:00:00+00:00\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Snickers Football Commentator Voice"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>A fun World Cup project voicing Snickers Arabia’s football commentator ads.</p>"}}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Watch the Snickers Arabia Campaign</h2>\r\n<p>Despite not being a big football fan, I seem to land a lot of football commentator voiceovers, and I’m definitely not complaining! Snickers Arabia got in touch after hearing my <a href=\"/football-commentator-voice\" title=\"Football Commentator Voice\">football commentator voice style</a> and booked me for several World Cup ads. If you'd like to hear more examples, you can also check out my <a href=\"/iboy-football-commentator\" title=\"iBoy Football Commentator Voice\">iBoy football commentator</a> or my <a href=\"/betfred-football-commentator\" title=\"Betfred Football Commentator Voice\">Betfred commentator voice</a> projects.</p>"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/GNaTR4Ai8Lo","title":"Snickers Football Commentator Voice","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/snickers-football-commentator-voice.jpg","alt":"snickers-football-commentator-voiceover","className":"blog-post-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Working With Snickers Arabia</h2>\r\n<p>Snickers hardly needs an introduction, it’s one of the world’s most recognisable chocolate brands. The team in Arabia were brilliant to work with and wanted a lively, high-energy football commentator performance. If you’d like something similar, have a listen to more of my <a href=\"/just-eat-uefa-football-commentator-voice\" title=\"Just Eat Football Commentator\">Just Eat commentator work</a>.</p>"}}]]}],[],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Get in Touch</h2>\r\n<p>If you’re creating a <a href=\"/commercial-voiceover\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">commercial</a>, <a href=\"/explainer-video-voice\" title=\"Explainer Video Voice\">explainer video</a>, or a sports-themed promo and need a strong football commentator voice, feel free to get in touch. I’m always happy to record a short sample from your script so you can check whether my delivery is right for your project.</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L4",null,{"pageTitle":"Snickers Football Commentator Voice","pageUrl":"snickers-football-commentator-voice"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L3","743",{"href":"/iboy-football-commentator","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/iboy-football-commentator.jpg","alt":"iboy-football-commentator","className":"blog-related-img"